      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "[Whenever a message is created, a transaction\nis created which creates entry in the messages table, \nand multiple entries, 1 for each participant in the \ninbox table.\nSince the DDB transactions only support 100 entries\ncreation, the group chat participant limit is 99 for me.]",
